00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:30.980
I want this!

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:33.070
That's not food.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.400
It's fine.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:35.940
See, it's cute.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:38.900
I got it.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:45.620
<b>The Winter's Fireworks</b>

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:46.270
