<b>The Winter's Fireworks</b>

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:48.910
You should have asked for something more expensive than that.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.250
Nayuki!

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:52.560
Auu.

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:56.170
What are you doing?

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:57.710
Oh my.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.840
Here, don't drop them.

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:02.800
Yeah...

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:08.500
Auu...

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:11.270
Geez, what are you doing?

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.520
I'm not to blame.

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:15.400
It's just hard to use this!

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:16.270
Huh?

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:19.740
Makoto, you've used chopsticks before, right?

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:21.490
Yeah...

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:24.450
But somehow, my hands are tired...

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.910
I'll bring a spoon right now.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:30.830
Akiko-san, that's going too easy on her.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:33.250
Makoto!?

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.130
Makoto!

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:35.540
Makoto!

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:47.390
Yes... My name is Minase.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:49.730
Yuu... ichi...

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:54.520
Yes... she suddenly collapsed...

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:57.190
Yes, please do so.

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:58.900
It seems that the doctor will see her.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.650
I'll go get a taxi.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:03.070
Yuuichi!

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:04.450
Nayuki.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:06.410
I'll go.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:09.620
Yuuichi, stay close to Makoto.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:11.960
Yeah.

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.880
Makoto, we've contacted the hospital.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.380
Yuuichi-san, what's wrong?

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:21.880
She's gone... Makoto is...

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:31.750
Auu.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:45.610
Makoto!

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:48.080
Where are you, Makoto!

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:49.370
That idiot!

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:51.290
Where did she go in that state?!

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:56.000
Maybe!

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.590
Makoto!!!

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:08.300
Where are you!

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:10.140
Where did you go!

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:17.900
Makoto!

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:23.860
What are you doing at a place like this?!

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:28.160
I... don't like doctors, so...

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:33.040
Idiot! If the doctor doesn't see you, something that's curable won't get cured!

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:35.540
Please...

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:38.580
I beg you... don't take me there...

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:41.750
Please... I beg you...

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:44.510
I understand.

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:48.220
I won't do something that you don't want.

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:51.390
So... let's go home now.

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:01.730
Don't get involved with that girl anymore.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:08.450
She will give you pain that you can't bear.

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:13.660
There's no reason for a complete stranger like you to say that.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:18.500
It's alright?

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:24.880
You will experience a seriously painful time from now on.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:41.520
How is she?

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:43.690
Yeah, it's settling down.

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:45.690
What are you going to do with your breakfast?

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:46.900
I'll eat it.

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:48.740
I have to go to school.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:50.490
You didn't sleep, right?

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:52.780
You shouldn't force yourself.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:55.200
It's alright. Other than that...

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:58.410
I'll take care of Makoto today.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.120
I'm sorry.

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:03.710
I was looking for you.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.130
I wanted to know what you meant last night.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:12.340
Who are... you!

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:15.560
My name is Amano Mishio.

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:19.310
You know, don't you? About her.

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:21.650
No, I don't.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.110
Then, why did you say something like that!

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:26.110
Do you know?

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:27.650
About her...

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:29.110
Nope...

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:31.780
She said that she has a grudge against me...

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:34.280
But, that must be some kind of mistake...!

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.700
You've met somewhere for sure.

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:37.490
You and her...

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.960
It is just natural that you don't remember.

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:47.840
That's because she didn't have the appearance of a human then.

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:52.260
What are you talking about?

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:59.520
There were some mysterious creatures from the past on Monomi Hill where you were last night.
(T/L Note: Monomi = Sightseeing)

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:04.810
The foxes that got mysterious powers from living so long...

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:12.650
Foxes were disliked in the past since they brought disasters upon villages.

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:15.820
Isn't that a myth?

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:18.370
It's not a myth.

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:20.750
She isn't human.

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:23.920
She came to bring disaster upon you...

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:25.460
Don't say any more!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:29.880
How could I believe that she is not a human being!?

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:33.470
Or that she is a monster who's here to bring disaster upon humans!

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.430
It's your choice not to believe.

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:37.970
But please bear this in mind.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:43.520
They must sacrifice two things in order to become human.

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:44.980
S-Sacrifice...?

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:48.150
"Memory"... and "Life"...

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:56.950
Makoto.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:01.080
Who in the world are you, I wonder.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:04.660
That is... something that I want to know as well...

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:06.670
Makoto...?

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:10.380
I was watching a dream...

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:15.880
A dream where I was all alone waiting on that hill from last night.

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:18.010
For who?

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:19.930
I don't know...

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:26.100
But, it was somewhat sad, and I couldn't forgive him very much...

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.190
Yuuichi...?

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:33.490
There's no need to worry. It's just a dream.

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:36.360
There's no one who would leave you alone.

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:41.490
Yuuichi... I have a favor to ask of you...

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:43.240
What is it?

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:46.540
Please read that...

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:49.380
I got it.

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:51.170
Love always occurs abruptly.

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:52.550
I was beginning to remember things...
Love always occurs abruptly.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:56.220
About the little fox that I found...

00:09:57.090 --> 00:10:00.140
It was severely wounded because it was in a trap...

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:04.640
I took care of it until it was able to run...

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:09.690
But, Makoto, who's right here, is that fox's reincarnation...

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:11.770
I can't believe such a crazy story like that...

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:13.780
I got it, I'll come pick you up for sure, so until then, "Sayonara".
