Auuu, more...!

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:22.160
It's enough.

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:23.660
You're sweating.

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:33.630
What? You can't take off the button?

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:37.010
Do it...

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:40.140
I understand.

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:51.770
Yeah... I didn't want to believe it...

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:55.070
That girl... she is not a human being...

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:12.300
It's spicy...

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:18.970
From that day, Makoto's condition grew worse day by day...

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:34.190
Here, give it to me.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:48.000
Right now, you're in a miracle that lasts only a moment.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:50.420
