00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:11.190
It's close... the time of the end...

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:15.280
Hey, Amano, is there any way to save her?

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:19.990
She's an idiot...

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:23.620
Why did she come to see me if it means sacrificing her own life...

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.080
To take revenge on me...?

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:28.370
Does she hate me that much...?

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.250
I think she was lonely.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:38.130
She was left alone, and wanted to see Aizawa-san all the time...

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:42.260
I think that wish made the miracle come true.

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:44.720
