00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:58.640
Thank you...

00:17:02.690 --> 00:17:05.860
Next morning... Makoto had a fever again...

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:11.530
I painfully knew the meaning of it...

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.280
It seems that the ambulance is coming now.

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:16.530
Is that so...

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:18.910
Nayuki, you've got to get ready.

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:20.540
Yeah...

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:30.380
Makoto, is there anything you want me to do?

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:37.100
You want to go somewhere?

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:43.020
You want to go to that hill...?

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:44.940
Yeah...

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:49.480
I got it!

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:51.190
Yuuichi!

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:52.490
Where are you going?

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:54.990
To the Monomi Hill.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:57.160
What are you thinking!?

00:17:57.450 --> 00:17:59.660
Makoto is a patient!

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.710
We must hurry and have the doctor see her...

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:06.460
The doctor can't cure Makoto's illness.

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:10.300
Nayuki, Akiko-san...

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:12.550
She wants to go home...

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:14.680
Where she was born...

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:16.800
"Where she was born"...?

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:18.850
The Monomi Hill is...?

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:21.600
Because her friends are waiting...

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:23.980
She's not a human...!

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:27.860
She is the reincarnation of the fox that I found in the past...

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:29.940
What are you talking about, Yuuichi!

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:31.440
Makoto is...!

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:37.070
Thanks...

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:48.380
Thanks... mother...

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:56.630
Well, I'll be leaving...

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:02.220
So it was her...

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:07.060
The kit that Yuuichi-san found in the past...

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:08.770
She liked it...

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:10.400
The sound of bells...

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:15.900
She was playing a lot with the bell that I had on my wallet...

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:20.120
I see...

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:29.290
Amano...

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:30.960
So, you're going...

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:33.000
To that hill...

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:34.090
Yeah...

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:36.470
Nice to meet you.

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:39.010
My name is Amano Mishio.

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:40.890
What is your name?

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:45.980
It's alright. It's not scary.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:48.940
Ma... koto...

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:50.440
"Makoto"?

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:52.360
I see, that's a good name.

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.360
Amano, thanks a lot.

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:56.110
You're welcome.

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:58.820
Makoto, let's play together again.

00:19:59.160 --> 00:19:59.950
Yeah.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:09.750
Don't sleep, Makoto.

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:11.630
We're almost there.

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:15.590
Let's play, Makoto.

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:18.420
Tinkle that bell you like.

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:23.300
Yeah, tinkle it more.

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:26.430
Can you see it?

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:28.390
That's the place where you were born.

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:31.600
Let's play together again.

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:37.280
When it's spring and becomes warmer, you will feel better!

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:41.110
So at that time, let's...

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:43.120
Makoto?

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:45.120
What's wrong, Makoto?

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:47.580
Hey, don't sleep!

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:49.540
We're at Monomi Hill!

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.420
No, it can't be...

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:56.500
It's too soon...

00:20:58.300 --> 00:20:59.380
Makoto...!

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:01.510
Makoto!

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:05.300
MAKOTOOOOOOO!!!!!!!!!!

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:11.980
It's really great weather.

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:15.310
Amano, you really sound like an older aunt as usual.

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:18.480
Please say that my demeanor is refined.

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:23.660
There's one thing I remembered...

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:27.330
About her name.

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:28.790
Name...

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:32.420
That's the name of my first crush.

00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:36.540
I talked to her about it a lot...

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:41.670
About how nice and beautiful the person named "Sawatori Makoto" was...

00:21:42.430 --> 00:21:44.680
It seems that she remembered it...

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:48.720
So, that was the guide for the two of you...

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:52.850
What's wrong?

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:54.350
Nothing.

00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:57.690
Are they running through the field on that hill again, I wonder?

00:21:58.190 --> 00:21:59.360
I guess...

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:04.360
In the small surging waves, a new life is born again, and being raised...

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:06.780
Life goes round... I guess.

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:10.330
Good bye... Makoto.

